{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":11,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_st02","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-5","storyName":"“致新生活”","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"目睹老师惨死的柳德米拉一路想尽办法向红复仇而不得，最后晕倒在荒野上，被偶然经过的索默尔带回了卡车互助会。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_05","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["整合运动成员","柳德米拉","红","餐厅老板","索默尔","含糊不清的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_bg_iceforest_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blizzard","layer":"1","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ghosthunter_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ghosthunter_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"subtitle","text":"老瓦西里是一位骁勇的皇帝。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"据说他已经年逾八十，依然能头戴宝冠走向战场。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"乌萨斯在雪原深处遭遇了惨败，死难同胞的尸体横于雪中，堆垒成墙。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"皇帝高喊着复仇，他的怒吼压过了风雪。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"残存的将士包围了营帐，但宝冠闪耀，人人只能高呼崇敬吾皇。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","text":"突如其来的剧烈北风吹起了营帐，众人终于敢抬头前望。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"宝冠已经坠落当场。雪原上已经不再有皇帝。据说最终，老瓦西里受众人践踏而亡。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","text":"营帐外跪倒的无名将士千万，无人知晓弑君之人姓甚名谁，又来自何方。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":16},{"type":"subtitle","id":17},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"bgeffect","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","duration":"1","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","duration":"1","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":25},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":26,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"喔，我头一次听你用叙拉古语讲这个故事。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"“弑君者”，原来你的名字是从书里来的——那本书叫什么来着？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"《正当与正义》。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"太难记了......我以为是那种全是大道理的大部头，原来是故事书？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"不，它不是故事书。那里面的故事不是用来让人娱乐，而是用来让人警醒。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"什么是“正当”，什么是“正义”？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"它们应该彼此混同吗？它们应该彼此矛盾吗？谁来为它们下定义？我们以为自己站在哪一边？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"还是说，它们其实都不存在。就像......已经完蛋了的整合运动一样。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"到头来，只是编一些漂亮理由的时候才用得到。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"嗯......我是说，就是在你给我讲这个故事之前，我只是想问，我们接下来该去哪？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"这就是我要说的——就在这里分别吧，兄弟。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"沿着这个方向，一直往前，你就可以走到树林边缘，就能看到旧的移动城市航道。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"那附近可能会有莱塔尼亚的边检队，也可能会有叙拉古货运陆行舰经过，得小心。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你经历过切尔诺伯格和龙门的战斗，避开他们应该不难。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"唉，足足三十多号人，我是最后一个了......","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"弑君者，我们为什么不能留在一起？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"留在一起只会成为那些掌权者的靶子，再不然就是再次变成被利用的炮灰。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你们不愿跟着九，所以我送你们离开。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"这是我作为整合运......这是我最后能做的。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"可是，那你要去哪呢，你不也变成孤零零一个人了吗？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"走一走，看一看，想一想。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"离开叙拉古前，我的老师劝过我，我不应该回到乌萨斯报仇，我的力量还太弱，我的觉悟也还不够......我没有听她的。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"现在或许是时候回去了，我想要去看看她。或许她可以再给我一点建议......可以让我变得更强。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"你的老师，是个什么样的人？","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"她来自一个叙拉古的家族。她是一个强大的战士，也是我见过最有智慧的人......她教会了我许多。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"叙拉古，那还有好长一段路吧。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"兄弟，看看雪地上的这堆篝火。曾经，它可以点燃感染者的愤怒，点燃整合运动的理想，烧遍整个乌萨斯。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"但是现在，它只够你和我取暖。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"听我最后跟你说——忘记塔露拉，忘记切尔诺伯格，忘记龙门，忘记整合运动，忘记我们这些人。选择了离开，就不要再去想了。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"甚至，忘掉身上的结晶吧。也许全忘掉了，你就能回家了。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"唉......","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"虽然我们都选择了离开，但我一直觉得你和我们是不同的......","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"你看上去懂很多东西，也读过很多书。有时候我觉得，你和大尉、塔露拉他们才更像一类人。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","focus":"r","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"唉......我的意思是，小时候我的爷爷就常说，读书太多的人，都容易钻牛角尖。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"总之......算了，再见，弑君者，祝你好运。你看上去确实需要一些好运。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_1002_nsabr_2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_1002_nsabr_2","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","focus":"l","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我们不会再见了，兄弟。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"charslot","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_rain","layer":"1","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"1","id":92},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_33_g2_srcalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shallowswalk","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","duration":"1","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":98},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"唔，尾巴弄湿了。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"还真是一点都没变。无论是这些脏兮兮的街，还是烦死人的雨。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"不知道为什么，乌萨斯的雪能要人命，可还是这里的雨更让人不爽。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"但愿老师家有吹风机......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":105},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"bgeffect","id":108},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$kjerag_n_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14side/m_bat_kjerag_n_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":109,"musicid":2},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"3","id":110},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_33_i16.png","xScale":"1.6","yScale":"1.6","y":"300","x":"350","fadetime":"3","id":111},{"type":"imagetween","duration":"10","xTo":"250","block":"false","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":113},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_33_i16.png","xScale":"1.7","yScale":"1.7","y":"300","x":"-100","fadetime":"1","id":114},{"type":"imagetween","duration":"10","xTo":"0","block":"false","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":116},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_33_i16.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","y":"150","fadetime":"1","id":117},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"0.88","yScaleTo":"0.88","duration":"30","yTo":"-20","block":"false","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"老师！！","id":120},{"type":"text","text":"化不开的血腥味。","id":121},{"type":"text","text":"她的老师仰面倒在地上，鲜血仍在向外流淌蔓延。","id":122},{"type":"text","text":"一把小刀掉落一边。","id":123},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉想要靠近，压住老师仍在流血的伤口，但她发现自己无法挪动一步，她连视线都无法移开。","id":124},{"type":"text","text":"有一股让她熟悉，又让她恐惧的气息正从阴影中浮现。","id":125},{"type":"text","text":"穿着红色连帽衫，有着灰色头发的狼。","id":126},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"image","id":129},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_bg_33_g8_srcroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_144_red_7#1","duration":"1","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"真狼死了，红听了外婆的话。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_1502_crowns","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,-80","posto":"0,0","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......是你。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你......做了什么......","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红是猎狼人，红听外婆的话。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"真狼死了，真狼没有反抗。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"6","times":"50","duration":"0.5","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"为什么......","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":154},{"type":"cg","duration":"1.5","from":"0","to":"1","id":155},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_6_18.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"cg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","id":160},{"type":"text","text":"为什么？","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"为什么从炎国到叙拉古，这个穿着红色连帽衫的家伙一直追在自己身后，就像是一个挥之不去的幽灵？","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你......","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你......你到底......","id":164},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你他妈到底是谁啊？！！","id":166},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":167},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"image","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":172},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_scorchedearth","layer":"1","y":"-200","id":173},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":176},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_1502_crowns","duration":"1","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":182},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":183,"musicid":3},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉沉默地看着面前的火，那是一个燃烧的行李袋，里面装着她的老师。","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉彻夜未眠，她在回想自己是怎么用盐巴和水简单擦去房间里的血迹，再趁着大雨未停，将老师的尸体拖到这荒野上。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"老师死前已经相当枯瘦，这一系列动作甚至不怎么费劲。","id":186},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉始终记得她与老师的相遇。","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"到处是血泊——她的舅舅，她在世上唯一的亲人，还有舅舅的亲属和仆人，一整个宅子都是他们的尸体。","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"送她来叙拉古的人告诉她，她的舅舅掌握着两三条街的生意，势力不算大，但在这座叙拉古小城，足以让她生活无忧。","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"可她甚至还没来得及适应新的生活......简易的源石炸药砸穿玻璃，一片混乱里，自己的手臂被划伤，颤抖着躲在了床底下。","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"那些冲进宅子的帮派成员，和冲进研究所的乌萨斯军警没有区别，她觉得自己回到了切尔诺伯格，回到了失去父亲的那个夜晚。","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"等到一切终于安静下来的时候，柳德米拉终于敢壮着胆子走出房间。","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"那些帮派成员同样躺在了血泊里，宅子里剩下的活人只有自己，和那个最低贱的仆人。","id":193},{"type":"text","text":"印象中她一直住在门房，负责收发信件，只在给老爷们送信的时候，才会瘸着腿进到宅子内部。","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"她走在地毯上都会踮着脚，以防发出太大的声响。","id":195},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":197},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“帮派仇杀，你的舅舅惹到了这些人。我要走了......你还有地方可去吗？”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":198},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“这些坏人都、都是你杀的？”","x":"600","y":"500","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":199},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“不然我会死，你也会死。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":200},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“为什么不在一开始的时候就救他们？”","x":"600","y":"500","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":201},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我以为他们是冲我来的......我这副身体，只有等他们靠近的时候，才有机会出手。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":202},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“你很可怕......你很厉害。我、我能跟着你走吗？”","x":"600","y":"500","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":203},{"type":"subtitle","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":205},{"type":"sticker","id":206,"text":"“你要报仇？替你的舅舅？你们都不熟吧。我有印象，送你来到这里的人，只是希望你安稳地活着......好吧，也不能够了。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700"},{"type":"sticker","id":207,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":208},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“柳德米拉，你知道成为我的学生意味着什么吗？”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":209},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我已经残废了，没什么大用，你却甘愿成为我的学生，我的工具？”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":210},{"type":"subtitle","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":212},{"type":"sticker","id":213,"text":"“我们都会后悔的，孩子。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700"},{"type":"sticker","id":214,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":215},{"type":"subtitle","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":217},{"type":"sticker","id":218,"text":"“我不后悔。只要你教我，教我拿刀，教我报仇，我就不会后悔！”","x":"600","y":"500","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"600"},{"type":"sticker","id":219,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":220},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“拿刀？不，拿刀对你来说太早了。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":221},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“先学会点火吧，烧掉这栋房子，和这里面的一切，让其他人再也找不到我们。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":222},{"type":"subtitle","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":224},{"type":"sticker","id":225,"text":"“柳德米拉，火会隐藏一切。”","x":"100","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700"},{"type":"sticker","id":226,"duration":"1"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"她选择以这样的方式替老师收尸，就像老师最开始教她的那样。","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"可是，然后呢？","id":229},{"type":"text","text":"离开整合运动后，她花了两年多的功夫回到叙拉古，再用短短一天的时间失去自己最后的归宿......","id":230},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":231},{"type":"dialog","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"bgeffect","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"火已经熄灭，早晨的风吹走了最后的灰烬，荒野上了无痕迹。","id":235},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉，接下来你该往何处去？","id":236},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我要......报仇。","id":239},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":240},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_33_g2_srcalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":248,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_144_red_7#1","duration":"1","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"char_1502_crowns","duration":"0.8","posfrom":"350,0","posto":"200,0","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"找到你了。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_144_red_7#1","focus":"l","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"你？你在找红？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"在这座城市，一个外来的杀手，并不难找。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你很显眼。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_144_red_7#1","focus":"l","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"不要挡红的路。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"别想离开！","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_144_red_7#5","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"唔。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_char_144_red_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"在动手前，我要问你一个问题——为什么？","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我没有听说过老师有你这样一号仇人，为什么和凯尔希混在一起的人，会认识我的老师？","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_144_red_7#5","focus":"l","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"真狼......应该死。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_char_144_red_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"这就是游戏的规则。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_char_144_red_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"什么游戏？！我听不懂你在说什么！","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我不管你是谁......你杀了我最后的亲人，我一定要你付出代价。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"char_144_red_7#1","focus":"l","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"你很弱，你打不过红。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"别小瞧我！","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"上次不过是被你偷袭得手，别以为我会怕你！","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_char_1502_crowns.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"-150,0","duration":"0.4","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0.2","id":285},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"-250,0","duration":"0.3","id":287},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ftrub","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0.3","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"450,0","posto":"450,0","duration":"0.3","afrom":"0","ato":"1","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"0.31","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"450,0","posto":"250,0","duration":"0.2","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","posfrom":"-250,0","posto":"-350,-30","duration":"0.5","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"shake","power":"10","times":"100","duration":"0.3","id":296},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":298},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","posfrom":"-350,-30","posto":"-350,-90","duration":"0.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......你很碍事。","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"别再跟着红了。","id":304},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"250,0","posto":"450,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"站......站住！","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我绝对不会放过你......","id":311},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchwindow","volume":"0.7","id":313},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"30","vibra